5,1,1,talk,Mio,,"Hi everyone! I'm so excited to pick the next show! I want to see where our money actually goes, so I'll check loan transport costs and mount-making charges!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I believe we need to be realistic about our capacity. I will look into the conservation lab staffing and the composition of the volunteer roster.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,I'm interested in what actually draws a crowd. I'll examine the weekend head counts and the five years of visitor comment slips.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must ensure the gallery can physically handle the exhibition. I'll check the structural survey of the suspended bay and the evening hire bookings.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"It is a pleasure to be here. To avoid any disappointments at the door, I shall look into lender paperwork and the maintenance log for powered displays.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Victoria, do you think the volunteers can help with the budget? I'm just worried about those surprise invoices!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, volunteers provide time, not funds. My concern is whether we have the actual hands to execute the curator's vision.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shion,,Logic suggests that popularity is the only true metric of success. I'm curious if the visitors' desires match our internal pride.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, popularity is irrelevant if the exhibition damages the floor or interferes with our evening revenue.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, let us all be kind. I simply want to ensure that whatever we promise actually arrives on time and stays working.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,"That's true, Shizue! I just don't want us to run out of money halfway through the season.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. A beautiful plan is useless if the staff is too exhausted to maintain it.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shion,,"I suspect we will find that the most ""sophisticated"" shows are often the least visited.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will be looking for hard limits. The building has a finite capacity for weight and movement.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I believe we have a very balanced approach. I am happy with these choices.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,Me too! Let's find some answers!,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
