40,2,1,talk,Mio,,Oh wow! Transport costs are huge—nearly a third of installation! And joiners are getting way more expensive unless the art comes with its own stands.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"It's quite grim. The conservation lab is down to one person with a massive backlog. Our volunteers are mostly town historians, not gallery specialists.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,1,talk,Shion,,As I suspected. People love mechanisms and live demonstrations; they get bored of static cased objects. They want to see people working.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,1,talk,Asuka,,"The suspended bay has a strict weight limit, and our evening hires mean we can't have permanent, open arrangements that can't be tucked away.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"I'm worried. Paperwork delays have caused openings to slip before, and powered displays have been breaking down during gallery hours.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shizue, if powered things break, does that cost more money? I'm seeing a pattern of hidden costs everywhere!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Mio, it certainly does. And with only one conservationist, any damage or stabilization needs will just sit in a pile.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Victoria, that's why we need a show that doesn't rely on fragile, static objects. We need something dynamic that attracts people.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shion, ""dynamic"" often means ""heavy"" or ""bulky."" We cannot ignore the weight limit of the bay or the needs of the evening caterers.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Asuka, you are right. And if the shipping paperwork is late, the ""dynamic"" show won't even open on time.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,3,talk,Mio,,"So we need something cheap to move, easy to set up, and not too heavy? That sounds hard!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,3,talk,Victoria,,And it must be something the current staff can actually handle without collapsing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,3,talk,Shion,,"It sounds like we need a show with a ""human"" element—something that brings the visitors back without needing complex, fragile mounts.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,3,talk,Asuka,,Precisely. It must be a low-impact installation that respects the building's physical and scheduling constraints.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree. We must avoid anything that relies on distant lenders with slow paperwork or temperamental electronics.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,2,4,talk,Mio,,I'll be looking for the most budget-friendly option!,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
56,2,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
57,2,4,talk,Victoria,,I will prioritize the workload.,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
58,2,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
59,2,4,talk,Shion,,I will look for the highest visitor appeal.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
60,2,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
61,2,4,talk,Asuka,,I will vote for the most structurally sound.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
62,2,4,pass,Asuka,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
